{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23612","headline":"宿灵岩寺上院 · 白居易","name":"宿灵岩寺上院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高高白月上青林，客去僧归独夜深。\n荤血屏除唯对酒，歌钟放散只留琴。\n更无俗物当人眼，但有泉声洗我心。\n最爱晓亭东望好，太湖烟水绿沈沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}